WEBVTT

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:44.960
It's the end of the year.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.820
Come one, come all!

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:49.850
Open for business!

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:53.060
Fish Paste!
Delicious herring eggs!

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:58.130
Hey, Mr. Hard-Working Student.
Workin' for a noodle shop, now?

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:02.040
Yup. You want some
noodles for New Year's?

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:05.760
Don't need it.
We'll be visitin' relatives.

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:08.800
What'll you be doing?

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:11.850
I'll be leaving for
home on New Year's Day.

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:21.710
I pity your parents. You should
go home before New Year's.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:25.320
I can't. I'm using my paycheck
to get home.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.290
Didn't your family already
send you money for the ticket?

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:30.960
I kinda spent it.

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:33.020
I have no sympathy.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:36.290
And what is Mr. Unsympathetic
doing for New Year's?

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:41.640
I am returning to the nest.
I've arranged for vacation time.

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:44.540
Your whole life's
''vacatlon time.''

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.770
What IS your job, anyway?

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.890
I'll never tell.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:08.990
Godai, it'll be lonely spending
New Year's in this wretched room.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.900
Who asked you?

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.960
He's right.
Not even a TV.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:16.640
The chilly atmosphere
strikes one to the bone.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.000
Alone on New Year's Eve.
That's especially harsh.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.910
Indubitably.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.730
So lonely!

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:31.260
Such despair!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.970
Hey Akemi, you're not
going home, either!

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.880
Where do you get off
trying to depress me?

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:43.650
Me? I'm gonna be watching
TV in the manager's room.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:47.190
W-With the Manager?
How nice.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:48.980
Jealous, huh?

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:55.530
I'll be so jealous.
I'll be so lonely.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.840
--You wanna come, too?
--Can I!?

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.870
One more'll make
the party lively!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.160
T-That's right!

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:15.110
Is it okay?

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:18.330
Of course it is.
The more the merrier.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.080
Okay, I'm off to work.

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:23.740
Do your best.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.860
I'll be back at nine, and
leave the noodles to me.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.590
Since I work
at a noodle shop--

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:29.970
New Year's noodles!

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:31.130
How kind of you.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.120
Godai!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:35.630
I'll accompany you.

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:41.320
Manager, a festive New Year's.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:42.800
Come back soon.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.810
Where is he going to?

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:51.420
Who knows?

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.020
We're off
to the boonies.

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.300
You'll be back on
the fourth, right?

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:20.830
No need to see us off.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:21.880
Happy New Year!

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:22.010
Bye!
Happy New Year!

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:22.750
Bye!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.810
Dad, let's
get a move on!

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:18.060
Soichiro, I've made it
through another year.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.190
Please protect me
from here on out, too.

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:26.550
Coming!

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:29.910
Hello, Maison Ikkoku?

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:33.230
Just a moment, please.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:39.560
Yeah?

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:46.810
Yeah, it's me.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.960
Skiing!? I'm goin'!

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:57.000
Six o'clock; Ueno Station
central turnstiles. Got it!

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:58.500
Bye!

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.170
Uh, oh.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:24.930
To go skiing?

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:28.740
Yeah, with friends.
But I can't, right?

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:33.480
I can't exactly leave
you alone with Godai.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:38.370
No one would be
there to save you.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.390
Yeah, I'll turn them down.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:45.740
A-Akemi--

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.670
You DO want
to go skiing?

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:50.710
I do, but--

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:52.240
Then go!

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:53.370
But--

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.160
I'll be fine!

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:57.030
And you won't
be in danger?

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.650
No! You're reading
too much into this!

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:01.810
You sure you'll be okay?

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.400
You've got to learn to
trust Godai a little more.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.230
You're right!

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:07.680
Of course I am!

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:10.650
Then I'd better pack!
Bye!

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:27.210
S-Soichiro, please protect
me from here on out!

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.740
Okay then
Manager, I'm off!

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:42.790
Come back soon!
Take care!

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:51.130
I'll bring you a
souvenir, okay?

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:52.870
See ya!

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.680
W-What's your problem!?

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:14.000
What am I gonna do?

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:18.820
I'll just have to make sure
the mood doesn't turn dangerous.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:32.270
Manager--

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:39.010
Isn't Akemi with you?

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:40.620
N-No--

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.830
Should I tell
him about Akemi?

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:52.870
--I love the smell of soap.
--I DID just take a bath.

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:54.420
I'll see you later.

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:56.710
Okay.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:03.020
Maybe I'm just being
hypersensitive.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.050
Freshly washed hair
is such a turn-on!

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:12.750
If only we could be
alone, it'd be heaven!

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:22.850
I'm gonna drink for
two years straight!

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:27.130
Now drink it all down:
chug-a-lug.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.300
What a strong
drinker you are!

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:33.700
I'm in a good mood, tonight!
I'm drinkin' like a fish!

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:35.430
And then--

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.630
Now that we've no
more distractions...

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.850
I washed myself thoroughly,
hoping for such a moment!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:52.530
Then you consent?

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:53.580
Please do!

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:30.740
Come in.

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:32.420
Welcome.

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:33.450
Thanks.

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:37.170
I've brought
noodles for three.

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:38.390
T-Thank you.

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:40.120
And this.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.220
Akemi can't ring in the
New Year sober, can she?

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:45.950
Where is Akemi?

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.320
Would you like
coffee or tea?

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:50.500
Coffee.

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:51.830
Okay.

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:53.030
Is Akemi--

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:54.970
One lump or two?

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:56.990
One lump, thanks.

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:02.920
So--

00:13:03.020 --> 00:13:03.780
Here.

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:05.390
Thanks.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:09.630
By the way--

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:12.130
I completely forgot
about the milk!

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:13.840
Do you want milk?

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:14.930
No thanks.

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:16.920
As I was saying--

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:19.070
Yes?

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:24.340
Coming!

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:26.820
Yes? Hello?

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:28.840
Akemi?

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:32.120
We just got to the lodge.
is Godai there?

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:35.830
Put 'im on.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:40.000
I'll tell him what I'll do
to him if he tries anything.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.950
Y-Y-You don't have to.
I-I-I'll be fine!

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:49.760
Okay, okay! But if he tries
anything, scream your heart out.

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:53.020
W-We should
trust him more.

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:54.910
Be careful!

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:56.240
Okay. Bye.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.420
I'll have to trust him.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:02.870
Akemi made it to
the lodge safely.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:05.240
Huh? Lodge?

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:08.050
To go skiing, of course!
Didn't you hear?

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:13.580
First I've heard of it.

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:17.870
Really? I could've
sworn that I told you--

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:21.260
Y-You did?

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:27.810
Then Akemi's not here--

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:35.360
I-It's kinda lonely,
just the two of us.

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:37.070
Yeah, kinda.

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:10.290
W-We're alone!

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:17.310
It's my chance!

00:15:17.820 --> 00:15:20.860
She could cry or ream, and
no one would interrupt us!

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:34.070
Can I have an orange?

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:35.210
Sure!

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.190
Must be nice, having a TV.

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:47.220
Aren't you going
to buy one?

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:50.680
Well, I've been so
busy with my tests--

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:52.780
I may start
saving up for one.

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:55.050
It really is
nice to have one.

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:56.430
Sure.

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:03.050
Who cares about
the stupid TV?

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:05.390
I'll grab her hand
from under the table--

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:18.400
That's right! I left rice crackers
under the heater.

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:27.770
The heat makes them
crispier and tastier.

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:29.490
Good idea.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:38.970
Okay, now in a
single move--

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:42.120
Is the volume too low?

00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:48.490
I-In one move--

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.260
I'll take her for my own!

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:15.140
Is something wrong?

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:16.930
Nothing--

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:27.080
That's right! We can't
have crackers without tea!

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:30.110
You're right! My mouth
was getting kinda dry--

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:36.050
Here.

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:03.130
Okay! It's time to
get the noodles ready.

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:05.040
Is there any way
I can help?

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:07.540
Just watch the television.

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:09.410
But I...

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:14.580
...don't wanna
impose--

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:19.390
It's nothing
to be worried about.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:21.210
But--

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.280
Okay, bowls--

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:35.540
Y-Yeah?

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:38.110
--Get some bowls?
--Okay!

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.030
Um... the bowls?

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:43.050
Okay!
Um... the bowls?

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:44.050
Okay!

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:50.370
Coming! Who could be
calling at this hour?

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:53.330
Hello?

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:55.350
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:18:57.040 --> 00:18:58.090
You left the pilot light on?

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:00.310
Sure! I'll take
a look right now.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:02.390
Goodbye.

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:07.030
I'll check on Room One.

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:08.060
Okay.

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:21.090
This is no good!
I'm so close!

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:31.810
Dammit!

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:40.440
Just one move!

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:50.190
Dammit
I wanna do it!!

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:14.240
D-Did you hear anything?

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:16.930
Yeah, a little.

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:23.650
Skiing!
I wanna go skiing.

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:25.620
I was a little
jealous of Akemi.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:29.130
You want to ski?

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:29.170
Oh, dear.
It was my mistake.
You want to ski?

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:31.090
Oh, dear.
It was my mistake.

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:42.020
This year departs, leaving
its memories, both good and bad.

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:45.020
That was delicious.

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:46.640
I should be going.

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:47.910
Already?

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:51.830
Yeah. We've had our noodles.
So, Happy New Year.

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:57.300
And what memories might this
temple bell be ushering in?

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:05.010
He didn't try anything.

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:07.880
Godai's a true gentleman.

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:15.300
I'm a coward!

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:36.710
Uh oh, I forgot!

00:21:57.560 --> 00:21:59.110
I was unfair to him.

00:22:00.890 --> 00:22:03.670
Yes, Godai's not
that kind of person.

00:22:18.580 --> 00:22:20.310
I'll never get that
kind of chance again!

00:22:21.910 --> 00:22:23.050
I choked under pressure.

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:25.920
I've decided!

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:27.970
I'll take him!

00:22:30.260 --> 00:22:31.370
I should have taken
her for my own.

00:22:38.600 --> 00:22:42.060
Godai? Godai?
You still awake?

00:22:43.940 --> 00:22:45.550
K-Kyoko!?

00:22:51.610 --> 00:22:56.180
Briefly, as I opened the door,
I imagined her in a negligee.

00:23:07.290 --> 00:23:08.840
Shall we visit
the temple together?

00:23:09.300 --> 00:23:12.520
S-Sure! I'd be
honored to accompany you!

00:23:14.630 --> 00:23:16.970
Ofcourse, Kyoko wasn't
that kind of girl.

00:23:21.640 --> 00:23:23.690
--I hope you have a good year.
--You, too.

00:23:24.640 --> 00:23:26.570
Do you have any wishes
for the New Year?

00:23:27.310 --> 00:23:30.270
Hmm. Just as long as
it's a good year--

00:23:30.650 --> 00:23:31.700
You're right.

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:43.290
This year, I'll take
her for my own!

00:23:50.300 --> 00:23:54.840
''Home is Where the Heart Lives,''
but Godai doesn't agree.

00:23:55.640 --> 00:23:57.540
He's kept his whole body
there for days on end!

00:23:58.310 --> 00:24:01.590
Next: ''Kyoko's Ticking Timebomb!
Godais Extended Absence.''

00:24:01.980 --> 00:24:05.900
I hate to admit it, but I can't
seem to smile without you.
